<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Certificate of Indigency - {{request.full_name}}</title>
  <style>
    @media print {
      body { margin: 0; padding: 0; }
      .no-print { display: none !important; }
      .certificate { page-break-after: always; }
    }
    
    body {
      font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 20px;
      background: #f5f5f5;
    }
    
    .certificate {
      width: 8.5in;
      height: 11in;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background: white;
      padding: 0.75in;
      box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
      position: relative;
      background-image: 
        linear-gradient(rgba(22, 163, 74, 0.03) 1px, transparent 1px),
        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(22, 163, 74, 0.03) 1px, transparent 1px);
      background-size: 20px 20px;
    }
    
    .header {
      text-align: center;
      border-bottom: 3px double #16a34a;
      padding-bottom: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }
    
    .logo {
      width: 80px;
      height: 80px;
      margin: 0 auto 10px;
    }
    
    .republic {
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: normal;
      margin: 5px 0;
    }
    
    .office {
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: bold;
      color: #16a34a;
      margin: 10px 0;
    }
    
    .title {
      font-size: 28px;
      font-weight: bold;
      color: #16a34a;
      margin: 30px 0 20px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
    }
    
    .content {
      line-height: 2;
      font-size: 16px;
      text-align: justify;
      margin: 30px 0;
    }
    
    .name {
      font-weight: bold;
      text-decoration: underline;
      font-size: 18px;
    }
    
    .purpose {
      font-weight: bold;
      text-decoration: underline;
    }
    
    .signature-section {
      margin-top: 60px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }
    
    .signature-box {
      text-align: center;
      width: 45%;
    }
    
    .signature-line {
      border-top: 2px solid #000;
      margin-top: 50px;
      padding-top: 5px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }
    
    .position {
      font-size: 14px;
      font-style: italic;
    }
    
    .footer {
      margin-top: 40px;
      font-size: 12px;
      text-align: center;
      color: #666;
    }
    
    .seal {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 150px;
      left: 100px;
      width: 120px;
      height: 120px;
      border: 3px solid #16a34a;
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 10px;
      text-align: center;
      color: #16a34a;
      font-weight: bold;
      opacity: 0.3;
    }
    
    .control-number {
      position: absolute;
      top: 20px;
      right: 20px;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #666;
    }
    
    .print-button {
      position: fixed;
      top: 20px;
      right: 20px;
      background: #16a34a;
      color: white;
      border: none;
      padding: 12px 24px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: bold;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
      z-index: 1000;
    }
    
    .print-button:hover {
      background: #15803d;
    }
    
    .back-button {
      position: fixed;
      top: 20px;
      left: 20px;
      background: #6b7280;
      color: white;
      border: none;
      padding: 12px 24px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: bold;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
      z-index: 1000;
      text-decoration: none;
      display: inline-block;
    }
    
    .back-button:hover {
      background: #4b5563;
    }
    
    .edit-button {
      position: fixed;
      top: 20px;
      left: 120px;
      background: #f59e0b;
      color: white;
      border: none;
      padding: 12px 24px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: bold;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
      z-index: 1000;
      text-decoration: none;
      display: inline-block;
    }
    
    .edit-button:hover {
      background: #d97706;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <a href="/secretary/dashboard" class="back-button no-print">← Back</a>
  <a href="/certificate-settings" class="edit-button no-print">⚙️ Edit Certificate</a>
  <button onclick="window.print()" class="print-button no-print">🖨️ Print Certificate</button>
  
  <div class="certificate">
    <div class="control-number">
      Control No: {{request.id}}-{{date_issued}}
    </div>
    
    <div class="header">
      <div class="logo">
        {{#if settings.logo_url}}
          <img src="{{settings.logo_url}}" alt="Logo" style="width: 80px; height: 80px; object-fit: contain;">
        {{else}}
          <svg width="80" height="80" viewBox="0 0 100 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <circle cx="50" cy="50" r="45" stroke="#16a34a" stroke-width="3"/>
            <path d="M50 20 L60 40 L80 40 L65 52 L70 70 L50 58 L30 70 L35 52 L20 40 L40 40 Z" fill="#16a34a"/>
          </svg>
        {{/if}}
      </div>
      <div class="republic">{{settings.republic}}</div>
      <div class="republic">{{settings.province}}</div>
      <div class="republic">{{settings.municipality}}</div>
      <div class="office">{{settings.office_title}}</div>
      <div class="republic">{{settings.barangay_name}}</div>
    </div>
    
    <div style="text-align: center;">
      <div class="title">{{settings.certificate_title}}</div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="content">
      <p style="text-indent: 50px;">
        TO WHOM IT MAY CONCERN:
      </p>
      
      <p style="text-indent: 50px;">
        This is to certify that <span class="name">{{request.full_name}}</span>, 
        of legal age, Filipino citizen, and a bonafide resident of 
        <span class="name">{{request.address}}, {{settings.barangay_name}}, {{settings.municipality}}, {{settings.province}}</span>, 
        is known to me to be a person of good moral character.
      </p>
      
      <p style="text-indent: 50px;">
        This is to certify further that the above-named person belongs to an <strong>INDIGENT FAMILY</strong> 
        in this barangay and that he/she is in need of financial assistance for 
        <span class="purpose">{{request.purpose}}</span>.
      </p>
      
      <p style="text-indent: 50px;">
        This certification is being issued upon the request of the above-named person 
        for whatever legal purpose it may serve.
      </p>
      
      <p style="text-indent: 50px;">
        Issued this <strong>{{day}}</strong> day of <strong>{{month}}</strong>, <strong>{{year}}</strong> 
        at {{settings.barangay_name}}, {{settings.municipality}}, {{settings.province}}, Philippines.
      </p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="signature-section">
      <div class="signature-box">
        <div class="signature-line">
          {{settings.secretary_name}}
        </div>
        <div class="position">{{settings.secretary_title}}</div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="signature-box">
        <div class="signature-line">
          {{settings.captain_name}}
        </div>
        <div class="position">{{settings.captain_title}}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    {{#if settings.seal_enabled}}
    <div class="seal">
      {{settings.seal_text_line1}}<br/>{{settings.seal_text_line2}}
    </div>
    {{/if}}
    
    <div class="footer">
      <p>{{settings.seal_text}}</p>
      <p>{{settings.validity_text}}</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  
  <script>
    // Auto-focus print dialog after page loads
    window.addEventListener('load', function() {
      // Uncomment to auto-print on load
      // setTimeout(() => window.print(), 500);
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>
